OL,3,AEx-FBI chief James Comey faces federal
OL,4,Acharges for third time
OL,5,
OL,6,FFederal prosecutors have taken steps to
OL,7,Fcharge ex-Federal Bureau of
OL,8,FInvestigation (FBI) Director James
OL,9,FComey with leaking national defence
OL,10,Finformation, according to a court
OL,11,Ffiling.
OL,13,FIt marks the third time the justice
OL,14,Fdepartment has moved to bring criminal
OL,15,Fcharges against Comey, a longtime
OL,16,Fcritic of President Donald Trump.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
