OL,3,AEx-FBI chief James Comey faces federal
OL,4,Acharges for third time
OL,5,
OL,6,FFew details are provided about the two
OL,7,Fcounts in the three-page filing, but
OL,8,FComey's lawyers said in separate court
OL,9,Fpapers that the case stemmed from an
OL,10,Falleged disclosure of classified
OL,11,Finformation to the New York Times in
OL,12,FOctober 2016, while he was head of the
OL,13,FFBI.
OL,15,FComey denied any wrongdoing in a video
OL,16,Fposted on Substack on Monday, calling
OL,17,Fthe charges an "appalling abuse".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
